  m_text: "Modern UIs is a collection of prefabs, scripts, and UI elements designed
    to help creators build clean, modern-looking interfaces and permission systems
    for VRChat worlds.\n\nThis world showcases a selection of features and systems
    included with Modern UIs. Its primary focus is ease of implementation and flexibility
    while maintaining a polished, modern appearance. At the same time, it is designed
    to be intuitive for users, providing a smooth, responsive, and satisfying.\n\n<b>Features:</b>\n\u2022
    Modular prefabs for fast, flexible UI building\n\u2022  Built-in permission systems
    with support for third-party integrations, including:\n    \u2022 VRC Linking\n   
    \u2022 Disbridge\n    \u2022 AccessTXL\n\u2022 Support for VRChat's Creator Economy\n\u2022
    Smooth, animation-driven transitions and feedback\n\u2022 Designed for clarity,
    usability, and a modern aesthetic\n\u2022 Easy to integrate and customize for
    different world setups\n\n<b>Interested?</b>\nTo acquire Modern UIs, join my
    Discord server under <b>https://discord.drblackrat.xyz</b> and check out the
    <b>#modern-uis-info</b> channel for more information."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
